ede dañar la red de la colonia.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 23.21, "end": 28.7, "words": [{"w": "Una", "s": 23.21, "e": 23.39}, {"w": "conexión,", "s": 23.39, "e": 24.05}, {"w": "sin", "s": 24.13, "e": 24.21}, {"w": "permiso,", "s": 24.21, "e": 24.73}, {"w": "le", "s": 24.77, "e": 24.85}, {"w": "baja", "s": 24.85, "e": 25.07}, {"w": "la", "s": 25.07, "e": 25.23}, {"w": "presión", "s": 25.23, "e": 25.69}, {"w": "a", "s": 25.69, "e": 25.79}, {"w": "los", "s": 25.79, "e": 25.91}, {"w": "vecinos", "s": 25.91, "e": 26.43}, {"w": "y", "s": 26.43, "e": 26.87}, {"w": "puede", "s": 26.87, "e": 27.11}, {"w": "dañar", "s": 27.11, "e": 27.57}, {"w": "la", "s": 27.57, "e": 27.69}, {"w": "red", "s": 27.69, "e": 27.91}, {"w": "de", "s": 27.91, "e": 28.03}, {"w": "la", "s": 28.03, "e": 28.11}, {"w": "colonia.", "s": 28.11, "e": 28.59}]}, {"scene": "mito", "text": "Pero cortarle el tubo a escondidas, o quitarle el agua por venganza, tampoco es la salida.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 29.0, "end": 34.23, "words": [{"w": "Pero", "s": 29.0, "e": 29.2}, {"w": "cortarle", "s": 29.2, "e": 29.76}, {"w": "el", "s": 29.76, "e": 29.88}, {"w": "tubo", "s": 29.88, "e": 30.2}, {"w": "a", "s": 30.2, "e": 30.22}, {"w": "escondidas", "s": 30.22, "e": 30.86}, {"w": "o", "s": 30.86, "e": 31.18}, {"w": "quitarle", "s": 31.18, "e": 31.66}, {"w": "el", "s": 31.66, "e": 31.78}, {"w": "agua", "s": 31.78, "e": 31.96}, {"w": "por", "s": 31.96, "e": 32.16}, {"w": "venganza,", "s": 32.16, "e": 32.74}, {"w": "tampoco", "s": 32.88, "e": 33.18}, {"w": "es", "s": 33.18, "e": 33.52}, {"w": "la", "s": 33.52, "e": 33.64}, {"w": "salida.", "s": 33.64, "e": 34.1}]}, {"scene": "pasos", "text": "Lo que funciona: primero, hablar con él, y ofrecerle un arreglo de pago.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 34.53, "end": 38.63, "words": [{"w": "Lo", "s": 34.53, "e": 34.69}, {"w": "que", "s": 34.69, "e": 34.83}, {"w": "funciona,", "s": 34.83, "e": 35.31}, {"w": "primero", "s": 35.61, "e": 35.93}, {"w": "hablar", "s": 35.93, "e": 36.25}, {"w": "